# /api/* belongs to the order gateway, not to this SPA. It is listed before the
# catch-all so an unreachable gateway cannot be answered by the app shell: the
# previous /api/exports calls got index.html back with HTTP 200, which made a
# backend that did not exist look alive and quietly fell back to fake data.
/api/*  /index.html  404

/*      /index.html  200
